      "description": "What a theme IS as data — the palette, the three required layouts, and the per-image regions (`textRegion`, `avatarRegion`). The PRODUCER stage: this is where a number is written down, and the rule is that geometry over art is declared rather than derived, because no amount of arithmetic on an aspect ratio can see where a picture is quiet.",
